## 12. Validation and prompts

- **§8–§11** are the source of truth for composition—not any deleted harness or demo app wiring.
- When generating new screens from prompts, prefer the general ownership model:
  outer inset owner, interior padding owner, vertical rhythm owner, separator owner, and overlay attachment owner.
- If a screen does **not** use a framed mobile preview shell, ignore shell-only mechanics and apply the same composition rules to the screen’s real root layout.

